OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAGreens deputy leader sorry over
OL,4,Alack of bin strike knowledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a minority coalition with the
OL,7,FLiberal Democrats and independents,
OL,8,FMillward's party has for several months
OL,9,Fbeen running Birmingham City Council,
OL,10,Fwhich has been in a standoff with
OL,11,Fmembers of the union Unite over pay and
OL,12,Fjob roles.
OL,14,FIn a post on X following the interview
OL,15,Fwith BBC Radio WM's Ed James, Millward
OL,16,Fsaid she had had to "face the reality"
OL,17,Fof not having up-to-date information on
OL,18,Fthe strike.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
